  "details": "<p><span>Anmurru</span>\u00a0is mentioned together with <span>Anduarsalla</span>, Kiaka, Luhsu, and Pur\u1e6dir in royal inscriptions of Sargon II. \u00a0<span>According to E. Forrer (</span><em>Die Provinzeinteilung des assyrischen Reiches</em><span> [1920] 75 and Map 2),\u00a0<span>Anmurru</span>\u00a0might have been located in Nemerli, opposite Keban, ca. 55 km northwest of Malatya.</span></p>",
